s *not* a row vector, since it has more than $1$ row (it has $2$ rows).\n\n- $B$ is *not* a row vector. It has only one column (and $4$ rows), so it's a column vector.\n\n- $C$ is a row vector since it has only one row.\n\nTherefore, only $C$ is a row vector."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335970 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050283 :topic/id #uuid "3cb2a10b-5d06-5efe-b222-3c14b0ccd7c8" :topic/math-academy-id 1777 :topic/title "Triangular Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a9d2a661-7d90-525c-9631-0c05ef108b03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438454} {:answer/id #uuid "5deab4fd-cb30-5b98-a484-4483eb06b0c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438455}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9d2a661-7d90-525c-9631-0c05ef108b03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438454} :answer-field/id #uuid "89c02379-086d-5617-b96e-c2e3ec7d9a9b" :answer-field/key "$A$ is upper triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439256} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69513619-f7d9-5728-9237-83bd49e641c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438456} {:answer/id #uuid "ab7677e6-30d1-5eff-a3c5-95011127b77e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438457}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "69513619-f7d9-5728-9237-83bd49e641c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438456} :answer-field/id #uuid "675400e7-a720-59bf-af25-ecd415319950" :answer-field/key "$A$ is lower triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439257} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63de0a7e-308e-5ca3-bfc3-0ba27b3a202e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438458} {:answer/id #uuid "179fafc0-1ae3-5917-a9f8-eae561e2b95b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438459}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "179fafc0-1ae3-5917-a9f8-eae561e2b95b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438459} :answer-field/id #uuid "d0b333bd-888b-5051-81d0-d4f153ba848c" :answer-field/key "$A+{A}^{T}$ is upper triangular." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439258}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "deb97145-eaf3-5dcc-a36b-24fae2c52b5c" :question/math-academy-id "q-68754" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $A$ is lower triangular: **False.** This fails because $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $A+{A}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **True.** This holds because the result of $A+{A}^{T}$ has all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nA+{A}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $A+{A}^{T}$ is upper triangular."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335978 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087713 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ed7286fe-b6e2-5544-8bc6-86afc6cdb813" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Matrix by Its Description" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048896 :topic/id #uuid "ca183854-66cd-5b1f-9d29-03785c3216b8" :topic/math-academy-id 861 :topic/title "Introduction to Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aec6ec60-6c46-5a6b-aae9-0f8a4513c381" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438466} {:answer/id #uuid "fba8bd52-1ee7-5a66-a030-067347942322" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438467}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aec6ec60-6c46-5a6b-aae9-0f8a4513c381" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438466} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0fe543b-67a1-5453-9b3c-14bda0f7fe07" :answer-field/key "$L = \\begin{bmatrix}4 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439262} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5da5d9a2-db50-58af-8e1a-2040c4743955" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438468} {:answer/id #uuid "79c2e8d7-436a-562c-8bb6-320f546f60ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true"